  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/09/IMG_2332.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>194 fotos del espect&aacute;culo R&eacute;nacer, de Arima Dansa, con la participaci&oacute;n de seis bailarinas ondenses, la tarde de este domingo en el reformado interiormente Teatro M&oacute;naco. Una historia de amor verdadero y &uacute;nico, con escenas de cama incluidas, &nbsp;y canciones rom&aacute;nticas de ahora y de siempre, dirigida art&iacute;sticamente por el tambi&eacute;n ondense Marcos Us&oacute; Salas y Ram&oacute;n Llorens.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/renacerarimadansamonaco140914/img_2133.jpg\" alt=\"img_2133\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/renacerarimadansamonaco140914/img_2137.jpg\" alt=\"img_2137\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/renacerarimadansamonaco140914/img_2138.jpg\" alt=\"img_2138\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/renacerarimadansamonaco140914/img_2139.jpg\" alt=\"img_2139\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/renacerarimadansamonaco140914/img_2142.jpg\" alt=\"img_2142\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/renacerarimadansamonaco140914/img_2143.jpg\" alt=\"img_2143\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/renacerarimadansamonaco140914/img_2145.jpg\" alt=\"img_2145\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/renacerarimadansamonaco140914/img_2146.jpg\" alt=\"img_2146\" style=\"max-width:100